<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_12__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Without prejudice to the generality of subsection (D)-"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
