<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_12__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "the Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, provide that any tax or duty payable under the Income Tax Act 1967 or the Stamp Act 1949 respectively shall be remitted where such remissions are necessary to give full and complete effect to any such agreement, bond, promissory note, instrument or guarantee;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
