<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_12__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Neither the Government nor any agency thereof nor any statutory authority nor the Central Bank of Malaysia shall, except as shall be otherwise agreed between the Minister and the Fund, create any lien on any of its assets as security for any external debt unless it is expressly provided that the lien will ipso facto equally and rateably secure the payment—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
