<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_12__subsec_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "of the principal of any loan; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
