<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_12__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of subsection (3), the assets of the Government include any right, interest or share which the Gpvernment has or may have in the Currency Fund or any part of the assets thereof, established under the Malay British Borneo Currency Agreement 1950."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
