<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Loans (International Fund for Agricultural Development) Act 1991."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
