<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall apply throughout Malaysia."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
