<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires— \"Consolidated Fund\" means the Federal Consolidated Fund established by Article 97 of the Federal Constitution; \"Fund\" means the International Fund for Agricultural Development; \"Minister\" means the Minister for the time being charged with the responsibility for finance; \"statutory authority\" means a local authority and any body incorporated directly by any written law and exercising powers vested in such body by law for public purpose."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
