<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding anything contained written law, the Government may issue such bonds, promissory notes or other instruments on such terms and conditions as may be necessary for the purpose of giving effect to the terms of any agreement which may be entered into by it with the Fund in respect of any borrowing under section 3(1). AGRICULTURAL DEVELOPMENT)"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
