<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "undertake such other obligations as may be agreed between the Government and the Fund in relation to or pursuant to any such agreement, bond, promissory note or instrument."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
