<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "A copy of any statement of any guarantee or undertaking referred to in this section shall be laid before the Dewan Rakyat. LOANS (INTERNATIONAL FUND FOR AGRICULTURAL DEVELOPMENT)"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/42/eng@> .
